# =============================================================================
# MADFAM Ecosystem Integration Environment Variables
# Copy these to your product's .env.local or .env file.
#
# Updated 2026-09-23 to the contracts in solarpunk-foundry README §IV:
# - Janua: one env contract, AUTH_JANUA_* (schema of record: @madfam/env).
# - Analytics: one host, https://plausible.madfam.io. Never Plausible Cloud.
# - Service API keys are SERVER-ONLY. `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` values are inlined into
#   the browser bundle, so no key, token or secret ever gets that prefix. Call
#   services from route handlers / server actions, or proxy through your app.
# Values below are placeholders; real secrets come from Vault via External
# Secrets in production (docs/PUBLIC_REPO_BOUNDARY.md).
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Janua SSO (Authentication) — server-only. See docs/JANUA_INTEGRATION.md.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
AUTH_JANUA_ISSUER="https://auth.madfam.io"
AUTH_JANUA_CLIENT_ID="<CLIENT_ID_FROM_JANUA_REGISTRATION>"
# Confidential clients only (e.g. the Auth.js `janua` provider):
AUTH_JANUA_CLIENT_SECRET="<SECRET_FROM_VAULT>"

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MADFAM Analytics (self-hosted Plausible)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN="your-product.madfam.io"
NEXT_PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_HOST="https://plausible.madfam.io"
# The ONE analytics host (owner ruling 2026-09-23). The templates refuse a
# Plausible Cloud host and send nothing rather than fall back. As of 2026-09-23
# this host is not provisioned yet (operator action), so no beacon is sent.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Coforma (Customer Feedback) — the key is server-only
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
COFORMA_API_URL="https://api.coforma.studio"
COFORMA_API_KEY="<SECRET_FROM_VAULT>"
NEXT_PUBLIC_COFORMA_TENANT_ID="madfam"
# The browser talks to your app's own /api/coforma route handler, which adds
# COFORMA_API_KEY server-side (templates/providers/MADFAMProvider.tsx).
# Product ID: a registry slug. The list is not kept here - import `productIds`
# (or `isValidProductId`) from `@madfam/core/products`, which is generated from
# the one product registry.
# Status: api.coforma.studio answered 502 on 2026-09-23 — check before wiring.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fortuna Problem Intelligence (optional) — server-only
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
FORTUNA_API_URL="https://api.fortuna.tube"
FORTUNA_API_KEY="<SECRET_FROM_VAULT>"

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Avala Competency (optional - for internal tools) — server-only
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
AVALA_API_URL="https://api.avala.studio"
AVALA_API_KEY="<SECRET_FROM_VAULT>"
AVALA_TENANT_ID="madfam"

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Forgesight Pricing (optional - for quoting products) — server-only
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
FORGESIGHT_API_URL="https://api.forgesight.app"
FORGESIGHT_API_KEY="<SECRET_FROM_VAULT>"
# forgesight.quest is retired (a parking page since 2026-08-30); never use it.
